"entity": {
"name": "WesBanco, Inc.",
"description": "WesBanco, Inc. is a bank holding company, which engages in the provision of financial services. It operates through the Community Banking and Trust and Investment Services segments. The Community Banking segment delivers services traditionally offered by service commercial banks, including commercial demand, individual demand, and time deposit accounts, as well as commercial, mortgage, and individual installment loans, and certain non-traditional offerings, such as insurance and securities brokerage services. The Trust and Investment Services segment includes trust services as well as alternative investment products including mutual funds. The company was founded on January 20, 1870 and is headquartered in Wheeling, WV.",
